{"kind":"html","caption":"用下标栈保存尚未匹配的左括号位置，并先放入哨兵 -1 作为当前有效区间的左边界。遇到右括号时先弹栈：若栈空，就把当前位置设为新边界；否则用“当前下标 − 栈顶”更新最长长度。示例 \")()())\" 中，最长值依次增长到 2、4，最后一个无法匹配的右括号只会重置边界。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>最长有效括号可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:grid;gap:8px}\nh1{margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.intro{margin:0;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.panel{border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;background:#252526;display:grid;gap:6px}\n.panel h2{font-size:13px;margin:0;color:#d4d4d4;font-weight:600}\n.string-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;transition:background .3s,border-color .3s}\n.cell .char,.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.cell .char{font-size:14px;color:#d4d4d4;font-weight:700}\n.cell .index{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.cell .pointer{min-height:10px;font-size:10px;color:transparent}\n.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff}\n.cell.active .char,.cell.active .index,.cell.active .pointer{color:#fff}\n.cell.in-best{background:#173654;border-color:#3794ff}\n.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px}\n.metric{border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 8px;background:#2d2d30}\n.metric span{display:block;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n.metric strong{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:#d4d4d4;font-size:13px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.stack{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;align-items:center;min-height:28px;font-size:11px}\n.stack-label{color:#8d8d8d;margin-right:4px}\n.stack-item{min-width:32px;padding:4px 6px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.stack-item.top{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.rule{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}\n.rule-card{border-left:3px solid #3c3c3c;padding:8px 10px;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:4px;font-size:11px}\n.rule-card.on{border-left-color:#3794ff;background:#173654}\n.status{min-height:auto;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:4px;background:#2a2d2e;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;font-size:12px}\n.progress{height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}\n.progress-bar{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}\n.note{margin:0;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <div>\n    <h1>下标栈扫描：s = <span class=\"mono\">\")()())\"</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"intro\">栈顶始终提供当前有效片段左侧的边界。蓝色格表示正在处理，深蓝格表示当前找到的最长有效子串。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <h2>逐字符扫描</h2>\n    <div class=\"string-row\" id=\"cells\"></div>\n    <div class=\"metrics\">\n      <div class=\"metric\"><span>当前下标 i</span><strong id=\"idx\">准备</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"metric\"><span>本步有效长度</span><strong id=\"length\">—</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"metric\"><span>最长长度 max</span><strong id=\"best\">0</strong></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stack\" id=\"stack\"></div>\n    <div class=\"status\" id=\"status\">先压入哨兵 <span class=\"mono\">-1</span>，它代表第一个有效区间之前的边界。</div>\n    <div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <h2>两条处理规则</h2>\n    <div class=\"rule\">\n      <div class=\"rule-card\" id=\"leftRule\"><b>遇到 “(”</b><br>把它的下标压栈，等待后续右括号匹配。</div>\n      <div class=\"rule-card\" id=\"rightRule\"><b>遇到 “)”</b><br>先弹栈；栈空则重置边界，否则计算 <span class=\"mono\">i - 栈顶</span>。</div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\">栈内存下标而不是字符，因此匹配完成后可以直接算出连续子串长度。整个过程只扫描一次，额外空间最坏为 O(n)。</p>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst chars = [')','(',')','(',')',')'];\nconst steps = [\n  {i:-1,stack:[-1],len:null,best:0,range:null,type:null,text:'初始化：压入哨兵 -1，作为有效区间的左边界。'},\n  {i:0,stack:[0],len:null,best:0,range:null,type:'right',text:'下标 0 是右括号。弹出 -1 后栈空，因此把 0 压栈，重置左边界。'},\n  {i:1,stack:[0,1],len:null,best:0,range:null,type:'left',text:'下标 1 是左括号：将下标 1 压栈，等待匹配。'},\n  {i:2,stack:[0],len:2,best:2,range:[1,2],type:'right',text:'下标 2 匹配下标 1。弹栈后栈顶为 0，长度 = 2 - 0 = 2。'},\n  {i:3,stack:[0,3],len:null,best:2,range:[1,2],type:'left',text:'下标 3 是左括号：将下标 3 压栈。'},\n  {i:4,stack:[0],len:4,best:4,range:[1,4],type:'right',text:'下标 4 匹配下标 3。栈顶仍是边界 0，长度 = 4 - 0 = 4，得到 “()()”。'},\n  {i:5,stack:[5],len:null,best:4,range:[1,4],type:'right',text:'下标 5 是多余的右括号。弹栈后为空，把 5 设为新的左边界；最长值仍为 4。'},\n  {i:6,stack:[5],len:4,best:4,range:[1,4],type:null,text:'扫描结束：最长有效括号子串是下标 1 到 4 的 “()()”，长度为 4。'}\n];\nconst cells = document.getElementById('cells');\nchars.forEach((ch,i)=>{\n  const el=document.createElement('div');\n  el.className='cell';\n  el.innerHTML='<div class=\"char\">'+ch+'</div><div class=\"index\">下标 '+i+'</div><div class=\"pointer\">当前 i</div>';\n  cells.appendChild(el);\n});\nconst cellEls=[...cells.children];\nconst idx=document.getElementById('idx');\nconst length=document.getElementById('length');\nconst best=document.getElementById('best');\nconst stack=document.getElementById('stack');\nconst status=document.getElementById('status');\nconst progress=document.getElementById('progress');\nconst leftRule=document.getElementById('leftRule');\nconst rightRule=document.getElementById('rightRule');\nfunction render(step,n){\n  cellEls.forEach((el,j)=>{\n    el.className='cell';\n    if(step.range && j>=step.range[0] && j<=step.range[1]) el.classList.add('in-best');\n    if(j===step.i) el.classList.add('active');\n  });\n  idx.textContent=step.i<0?'准备':step.i>=chars.length?'结束':step.i;\n  length.textContent=step.len==null?'—':step.len;\n  best.textContent=step.best;\n  stack.innerHTML='<span class=\"stack-label\">栈底 → 栈顶</span>';\n  step.stack.forEach((v,j)=>{\n    const item=document.createElement('span');\n    item.className='stack-item'+(j===step.stack.length-1?' top':'');\n    item.textContent=v;\n    stack.appendChild(item);\n  });\n  status.textContent=step.text;\n  leftRule.classList.toggle('on',step.type==='left');\n  rightRule.classList.toggle('on',step.type==='right');\n  progress.style.width=((n+1)/steps.length*100)+'%';\n}\nlet current=0;\nrender(steps[current],current);\nsetInterval(()=>{\n  current=(current+1)%steps.length;\n  render(steps[current],current);\n},2200);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
